    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "多くの人が海と聞いて思い浮かべるような、\r\n夏の眩しさとは違っていて──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……どうだろう\r\n私はこのしっとりした空気も好きなのだけれど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "目玉の一枚としては、少し寂しいだろうか\r\nもう少し華やかな方がいいのかな",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の好みで、スタッフさんたちを\r\n困らせるような結果になってしまうのは避けたいし──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一旦、先方の都合は考えずにおこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "先方が求めているのは、\r\n咲耶の『やりたい』っていう気持ちだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから咲耶は、まずはなんにも混じりけのない、\r\n咲耶の希望を出すべきなんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何か懸念があった時は、\r\n話を聞いたうえで、相談してくれるはずだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今、ひとりで先回りして考える必要はないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうだね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "どうしても、これは喜んでもらえる答えだろうか、\r\nという考えが離れなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶は他人思いだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そんな大層なものではないよ",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020180"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……でも、きっと。『秋の海は難しい』と言われれば、\r\n私は他の案を考えるだろう",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは恐らく、『私はこれが撮りたい！』という熱意とは\r\n少し違う気持ちだね──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……もっと、考えてみるよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "一緒に頑張ろうな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "待ってるぞ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "──頑張れ！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020220,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日みたいにどこかに行ってみるのでも、\r\n何か資料を探すのでも、なんでもいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺で手伝えることがあったら、必ず教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶がいい答えを選べるように、\r\n俺も全力を尽くすから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ\r\n──やっぱり、心強いな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020230"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶ならきっと、\r\n咲耶の撮りたいものを見つけられる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "こんなに迷っている私を信じてくれるのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "当たり前だろ\r\nそれに、迷うのは悪いことじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それだけ咲耶が真剣に向き合ってるって証拠だ\r\nだから、さ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、まったく",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつもながら、私に甘いプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、根を詰めすぎずに、ある程度気楽にな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフッ、なかなか難しいオーダーだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……なんていうか",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『撮りたい！』が『撮らなきゃ！』になっちゃうのは\r\nもったいないよなって思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶自身がわくわくすること──みたいな感じでさ\r\n難しく考えすぎないでほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012020290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601202/2006012020290"
  },
  {
